  </p>

  <h2>What Resurface is</h2>
  <p>
    A revision platform for UK medical students. It turns study material you
    provide, such as Anki decks, lecture slides, PDFs and notes, into exam-style
    questions, schedules them for review, and tracks your progress. You can also
    share decks with other students, and use decks that Resurface features for
    everyone.
  </p>
  <p>
    It is a study aid. It does not replace your curriculum, lectures, textbooks
    or clinical teachers, and it is not affiliated with any medical school,
    examining body or the GMC.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Questions made with Generate and answers from Resurface AI are written by an
    AI model and are <strong>not checked by us before you see them</strong>. They
    can be wrong while sounding confident. Decks shared by other students, and
    decks Resurface features, are written by students and may contain mistakes
    too. Medicine also changes, so something correct when written may not be now.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not promise that any content is accurate, complete or current. If you
    spot a mistake, use Report on the question so it can be fixed.
  </p>

  <h2>Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use a real email address and keep your sign-in to yourself.</li>
    <li>One account per person. You are responsible for what happens on yours.</li>
    <li>
      Tell us at <a href="mailto:hello@tryresurface.com">hello@tryresurface.com</a>{" "}
