    </li>
    <li>You can delete your account at any time in Profile.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Names and photos</h2>
  <p>
    Your display name and profile photo are seen by other students on the
    leaderboard and on decks you share. Keep them appropriate: nothing offensive,
    explicit, or pretending to be someone else. We may remove a name or photo that
    breaks this, and repeated misuse can lead to your account being suspended.
  </p>

  <h2>Using Resurface fairly</h2>
  <p>Please do not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Upload or share material you do not have the right to use, such as
      textbooks or paid question banks you are not allowed to copy.
    </li>
    <li>
